4361210195912", "text": "Is that a trial reel?", "timestamp": 1793785335, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "mermaid_iwn", "author_id": "40451471191", "id": "18644672146053662", "text": "Am I the only one that thinks she also forgot that vending machines,  the fountain and locking all the doors makes a lot of noise when everyone is silent?", "timestamp": 1793779620, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "memorizer_a", "author_id": "58002457971", "id": "18019689275990669", "text": "Tbh she forgot 2, firstly because phones can still make sound for the emergency warning, she has to turn them off. Secondly, she forgot to check the students", "timestamp": 1793765560, "like_count": 3}, {"author": "amru.hikari", "author_id": "50293309889", "id": "17918187669531106", "text": "A suspicious person who may have a bite mark could already be in the library with her", "timestamp": 1793757112, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "ebakmendota67", "author_id": "73242364376", "id": "18027070427870832", "text": "BIOLAB", "timestamp": 1793742108, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "little_welsh_gem", "author_id": "52832296388", "id": "18064057877801840", "text": "Turn the phones off because alarms and alerts don’t care about silent, and I know that from school :(", "timestamp": 1793741860, "like_count": 57}, {"author": "hopelowres_", "author_id": "79620300034", "id": "17992537472867215", "text": "Someone there might be infected already, or the windows might be able to be opened", "timestamp": 1793741435, "like_count": 26}, {"author": "dayzero.story", "author_id": "23973906610", "id": "18654145231055900", "text": "If you liked this, you'll love THE LAST TRAIN 🚆 Same apocalypse, a driver with 200 passengers and no way to stop. All parts are on my page, FOLLOW❤️", "timestamp": 1793738920, "like_count": 8}, {"author": "matteo_colucci12", "author_id": "78122448173", "id": "18115911230123216", "text": "She didn’t see the person with the bloody bandage on her arm!!", "timestamp": 1793738459, "like_count": 67}, {"author": "dayzero.story", "author_id": "23973906610", "id": "17971066836076367", "text": "What did she forget? Comment 👇", "timestamp": 1793737718, "like_count": 8}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DfSsiEiNB5Z/", "webpage_url_basename": "DfSsiEiNB5Z", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/856155496_18131456872794611_7964417088716720514_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAyMjQ3MzI3MjU3Mjc4MDEyMTE4MTMxNDU2ODY5Nzk0NjEx.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fdXNlcl9zZWxlY3RlZF90aHVtYm5haWwuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=Secvwts7TKoQ7kNvwFJLs5t&_nc_oc=Adp75g4IhEP9RsPsOy_h_Ot4U5OO6qFWu0VCffKFMVsweoWNuFnyX32KXFSFNvdGOw00AJdzGZeRxcJrEi598Kkl&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna&_nc_gid=_mSywzNbB2HCpok8G764FA&_nc_ss=70689&oh=00_AQTpbbocPXKolGYN2zcKA-aKV90XNtEUA_uMUN8bnxH4Lw&oe=6AF8176E", "display_id": "DfSsiEiNB5Z", "fulltitle": "Video by dayzero.story", "upload_date": "20261103", "epoch": 1794261343, "format": "dash-2017969092923415v - 1080x1920 (DASH video)+dash-2017968819590109a - audio only (DASH audio)", "format_id": "dash-2017969092923415v+dash-2017968819590109a", "ext": "mp4", "protocol": "https+https", "format_note": "DASH video+DASH audio", "tbr": 668.397, "width": 1080, "height": 1920, "resolution": "1080x1920", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "vcodec": "vp09.00.40.08.00.01.01.01.00", "vbr": 600.976, "aspect_ratio": 0.56, "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "abr": 67.421, "asr": 44100, "_type": "video", "_version": {"version": "2026.10.26", "release_git_head": "c91f8de0bfb3577894abad716eaaa01659e6bd14", "repository": "yt-dlp/yt-dlp"}}